{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>El</b> — This is the reproof, and he called them משיחי like נסיכי. Perhaps so Abraham was a prophet, restoring another man's wife, \"for he is a prophet,\" and Isaac's blessing to Jacob in prophecy is like the blessing of Moses."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 105, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:38:24.629608078Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}